          "text": "«Publishers for Palestine is a global collective of publishers, and others who work in publishing around the world, who stand for justice, freedom of expression, and the power of the written word. You can read our statement of solidarity in English, en Français, en Català, dalam bahasa Indonesia, اردو میں, بالعربية, 中文, 日本語で, 한국어로, po Polsku, Suomen kielellä, and Στα ελληνικα. More languages are forthcoming.»",
